From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ezra Kruger <ekruges@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 27 Jul 2026 06:31:00 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 5/7] ipc/i3bar: taskbar chips for minimized windows

New GET_SCRATCHPAD IPC message (type 13): one entry per scratchpad
window with con id, X window, name, class, and urgency. i3bar
subscribes to window events, keeps the list current, and renders one
chip per window right of the workspace buttons: _NET_WM_ICON when the
app provides one, a class-letter tile otherwise, urgent chips blinking
in the urgent workspace colors. Clicking a chip shows the window.
